# config.hpp 伪代码

---

## 工具函数

```
--------------------------------
数学工具函数
来源: csrc/config.hpp
--------------------------------

【函数】
    ceil_div<T>(a: T, b: T) -> T
        用途: 向上整除，计算 ⌈a/b⌉

    align_up<T>(a: T, b: T) -> T
        用途: 向上对齐到 b 的倍数

    align_down<T>(a: T, b: T) -> T
        用途: 向下对齐到 b 的倍数
```

---

## 配置结构

```
--------------------------------
Config (通信配置)
来源: csrc/config.hpp
--------------------------------

【状态】
    num_sms: int                             # SM (Streaming Multiprocessor) 数量
    num_max_nvl_chunked_send_tokens: int     # NVLink 分块发送最大 token 数
    num_max_nvl_chunked_recv_tokens: int     # NVLink 分块接收最大 token 数
    num_max_rdma_chunked_send_tokens: int    # RDMA 分块发送最大 token 数
    num_max_rdma_chunked_recv_tokens: int    # RDMA 分块接收最大 token 数

【接口】
    Config(num_sms, num_max_nvl_chunked_send_tokens, num_max_nvl_chunked_recv_tokens,
           num_max_rdma_chunked_send_tokens, num_max_rdma_chunked_recv_tokens)
        参数: 初始化上述5个字段
        用途: 构造配置对象
        约束:
            - num_sms >= 0
            - num_max_nvl_chunked_send_tokens > 0 && num_max_nvl_chunked_recv_tokens > 0
            - num_max_nvl_chunked_send_tokens < num_max_nvl_chunked_recv_tokens
            - num_max_rdma_chunked_send_tokens > 0 && num_max_rdma_chunked_recv_tokens > 0
            - num_max_rdma_chunked_send_tokens <= num_max_rdma_chunked_recv_tokens / 2  # RDMA lazy head update 约束
        副作用:
            - 将 num_max_rdma_chunked_recv_tokens 向上对齐到 num_max_rdma_chunked_send_tokens 的倍数

    get_nvl_buffer_size_hint(hidden_bytes: size_t, num_ranks: int) -> size_t
        用途: 计算 NVLink buffer 推荐大小
        约束:
            - num_ranks < NUM_MAX_NVL_PEERS 或 num_ranks % NUM_MAX_NVL_PEERS == 0
            - num_ranks > NUM_MAX_NVL_PEERS 时，num_sms % 2 == 0
        算法:
            num_rdma_ranks = max(num_ranks / NUM_MAX_NVL_PEERS, 1)
            num_nvl_ranks = min(num_ranks, NUM_MAX_NVL_PEERS)
            num_channels = num_sms / 2
            
            bytes = 0
            bytes += num_channels * num_nvl_ranks * (2*num_rdma_ranks + 3) * sizeof(int)  # 控制信息
            bytes += num_channels * num_nvl_ranks * num_max_nvl_chunked_recv_tokens * hidden_bytes  # 隐藏层数据
            bytes += num_channels * num_nvl_ranks * num_max_nvl_chunked_recv_tokens * internode::get_source_meta_bytes()  # 元数据
            bytes += num_channels * num_nvl_ranks * num_max_nvl_chunked_recv_tokens * kNumMaxTopK * (sizeof(topk_idx_t) + sizeof(float))  # topk 索引+值
            bytes += num_channels * num_nvl_ranks * num_max_nvl_chunked_recv_tokens * kNumMaxScales * sizeof(float)  # scales
            return align_up(bytes, 128)

    get_rdma_buffer_size_hint(hidden_bytes: int64, num_ranks: int) -> size_t
        用途: 计算 RDMA buffer 推荐大小
        约束:
            - num_ranks % NUM_MAX_NVL_PEERS == 0
            - num_sms % 2 == 0
        算法:
            if num_ranks <= NUM_MAX_NVL_PEERS:
                return 0  # Legacy mode 不需要 RDMA buffer
            
            num_rdma_ranks = num_ranks / NUM_MAX_NVL_PEERS
            num_channels = num_sms / 2
            
            bytes = 0
            bytes += num_channels * num_rdma_ranks * (NUM_MAX_NVL_PEERS*2 + 2) * 2 * sizeof(int)  # 控制信息 (双缓冲)
            bytes += num_channels * num_rdma_ranks * num_max_rdma_chunked_recv_tokens * hidden_bytes * 2  # 数据 (双缓冲)
            bytes += num_channels * num_rdma_ranks * num_max_rdma_chunked_recv_tokens * internode::get_source_meta_bytes() * 2
            bytes += num_channels * num_rdma_ranks * num_max_rdma_chunked_recv_tokens * kNumMaxTopK * (sizeof(topk_idx_t) + sizeof(float)) * 2
            bytes += num_channels * num_rdma_ranks * num_max_rdma_chunked_recv_tokens * kNumMaxScales * sizeof(float) * 2
            bytes += num_channels * num_rdma_ranks * num_max_rdma_chunked_recv_tokens * sizeof(int4) * 2  # 额外控制信息
            return align_up(bytes, 128)

【常量】
    kNumMaxTopK = 128      # 最大 topk 数量
    kNumMaxScales = 128    # 最大 scales 数量

【依赖】
    internode::get_source_meta_bytes()   # 获取 internode 元数据大小
    NUM_MAX_NVL_PEERS                    # NVLink 最大对等节点数
    NUM_BUFFER_ALIGNMENT_BYTES           # Buffer 对齐字节数
```

