## 低延迟通信结构

```
--------------------------------
LowLatencyBuffer (低延迟 buffer 指针集合)
来源: csrc/config.hpp
--------------------------------

【状态】
    num_clean_int: int                              # 需要清理的 int 数量
    
    # Dispatch 阶段
    dispatch_rdma_send_buffer: void*                # RDMA 发送 buffer
    dispatch_rdma_recv_data_buffer: void*           # RDMA 接收数据 buffer
    dispatch_rdma_recv_count_buffer: int*           # RDMA 接收计数 buffer
    
    # Combine 阶段
    combine_rdma_send_buffer: void*                 # RDMA 发送 buffer
    combine_rdma_recv_data_buffer: void*            # RDMA 接收数据 buffer
    combine_rdma_recv_flag_buffer: int*             # RDMA 接收标志 buffer
    
    # 辅助字段
    combine_rdma_send_buffer_data_start: void*      # Combine 发送数据起始位置
    num_bytes_per_combine_msg: size_t               # 每个 combine 消息字节数

【接口】
    clean_meta() -> (int*, int)
        用途: 获取需要清理的元数据指针和数量
        约束: dispatch_rdma_recv_count_buffer == combine_rdma_recv_flag_buffer
        返回: (buffer指针, num_clean_int)
```

```
--------------------------------
LowLatencyLayout (低延迟 buffer 布局管理)
来源: csrc/config.hpp
--------------------------------

【状态】
    total_bytes: size_t          # 总字节数
    buffers[2]: LowLatencyBuffer # 双缓冲区 (odd/even)

【接口】
    LowLatencyLayout(rdma_buffer: void*, num_max_dispatch_tokens_per_rank: int,
                     hidden: int, num_ranks: int, num_experts: int)
        参数:
            - rdma_buffer: RDMA buffer 基地址
            - num_max_dispatch_tokens_per_rank: 每个 rank 最大 dispatch token 数
            - hidden: 隐藏层维度
            - num_ranks: rank 总数
            - num_experts: expert 总数
        用途: 初始化双缓冲区布局
        约束:
            - num_scales * sizeof(float) <= hidden  # scales 不超过 hidden size
        
        算法:
            num_scales = hidden / 128
            
            # 计算消息大小
            num_bytes_per_dispatch_msg = sizeof(int4) + max(hidden * sizeof(nv_bfloat16),
                                                             hidden + num_scales * sizeof(float))
            num_bytes_per_combine_msg = num_scales * sizeof(nv_bfloat162) + hidden * sizeof(nv_bfloat16)
            
            # 计算 buffer 大小
            dispatch_send_buffer_bytes = num_max_dispatch_tokens_per_rank * num_bytes_per_dispatch_msg
            combine_send_buffer_bytes = num_experts * num_max_dispatch_tokens_per_rank * num_bytes_per_combine_msg
            send_buffer_bytes = max(dispatch_send_buffer_bytes, combine_send_buffer_bytes)
            assert send_buffer_bytes % sizeof(int4) == 0
            
            dispatch_recv_data_buffer_bytes = num_experts * num_max_dispatch_tokens_per_rank * num_bytes_per_dispatch_msg
            combine_recv_buffer_bytes = num_experts * num_max_dispatch_tokens_per_rank * num_bytes_per_combine_msg
            recv_buffer_bytes = max(dispatch_recv_data_buffer_bytes, combine_recv_buffer_bytes)
            assert recv_buffer_bytes % sizeof(int4) == 0
            
            dispatch_recv_count_buffer_bytes = num_experts * sizeof(int)
            combine_recv_flag_buffer_bytes = dispatch_recv_count_buffer_bytes
            signaling_buffer_bytes = max(dispatch_recv_count_buffer_bytes, combine_recv_flag_buffer_bytes)
            signaling_buffer_bytes_aligned = align_up(signaling_buffer_bytes, 128)
            
            total_bytes = send_buffer_bytes * 2 + recv_buffer_bytes * 2 + signaling_buffer_bytes_aligned * 2
            
            # 布局：[signaling0][signaling1][send0][send1][recv0][recv1]
            for i in [0, 1]:
                buffers[i].num_clean_int = signaling_buffer_bytes / sizeof(int)
                buffers[i].dispatch_rdma_send_buffer = rdma_buffer + signaling_aligned*2 + send_bytes*i
                buffers[i].dispatch_rdma_recv_data_buffer = rdma_buffer + signaling_aligned*2 + send_bytes*2 + recv_bytes*i
                buffers[i].dispatch_rdma_recv_count_buffer = rdma_buffer + signaling_aligned*i
                buffers[i].combine_rdma_send_buffer = buffers[i].dispatch_rdma_send_buffer
                buffers[i].combine_rdma_recv_data_buffer = buffers[i].dispatch_rdma_recv_data_buffer
                buffers[i].combine_rdma_recv_flag_buffer = buffers[i].dispatch_rdma_recv_count_buffer
                buffers[i].combine_rdma_send_buffer_data_start = buffers[i].combine_rdma_send_buffer
                buffers[i].num_bytes_per_combine_msg = num_bytes_per_combine_msg

    advance<out_ptr_t, count_ptr_t, in_ptr_t>(ptr: in_ptr_t, count: size_t) -> out_ptr_t
        用途: 指针算术，将 ptr 前进 count 字节并转换为目标类型

【备注】
    - 布局设计：dispatch 和 combine 共享同一块 buffer，通过不同的起始偏移区分
    - 双缓冲设计：奇偶交替使用，支持 pipeline 并行
    - Buffer 对齐：所有 buffer 起始地址按 128 字节对齐
```

---

## 全局工具函数

```
--------------------------------
低延迟 RDMA 尺寸计算
来源: csrc/config.hpp
--------------------------------

【函数】
    get_low_latency_rdma_size_hint(num_max_dispatch_tokens_per_rank: int, hidden: int,
                                    num_ranks: int, num_experts: int) -> size_t
        用途: 计算低延迟模式 RDMA buffer 推荐大小
        算法:
            layout = LowLatencyLayout(nullptr, num_max_dispatch_tokens_per_rank, hidden, num_ranks, num_experts)
            return align_up(layout.total_bytes, NUM_BUFFER_ALIGNMENT_BYTES)
```
